<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal government outlines Cimpor sale details.</title>
<headline>Portugal government outlines Cimpor sale details.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's government plans to sell 16 million shares of Cimpor-Cimentos de Portugal in a public offer for sale (OPV) and 18.96 million by direct sale in the privatisation of 45 percent of the cement group, a spokesman said.</p>
</text>
